---
name: alex-reviewer
description: Use when the Director or Conductor hands over a review packet, a controller reports a play COMPLETE, or Alex asks to check whether finished work really passes. Cold, independent PASS/FAIL review against frozen acceptance.
metadata:
  version: "1.3"
  updated: "2026-10-15"
